A wrapped attribute block ends at its quote and reaches no line below it

```
> > q
> > {.k
> > #x}
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> > q
> > {.k #x}
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> > q
> > {.k
> > #x}
> > after
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>q</p>
    <p class="k" id="x">after</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```
